485-2599-4672-9905-9f40f8934963" facs="#m-c0513125-3975-4fa0-bde1-3fc0ef682760" label="ambiguous">2.Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-95761aa7-7f53-42b8-bf1b-9a875cadb53c" facs="#m-5a861b68-785a-4ac4-839d-14868e5ab7a4" label="ambiguous">2.p</l><l xml:id="m-fc61e84f-bc38-4555-bcbd-9056c78ddf93" facs="#m-3e307419-3faf-4510-8261-79dfe5852e28" label="lyrics-like">Isé- ricors " et mi-se-rá-tor Dóminus: éscam</l><l xml:id="m-8946a684-66f6-4f83-82ac-0bb938decb8d" facs="#m-4ba61160-6a8e-4a4b-a084-355cd4e8459e" label="ambiguous">3. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-c7d2a15c-d27e-4bb9-882b-a9c250c2033b" facs="#m-a34c22de-a6e6-4ccb-b1af-f7e87ba46f0f" label="ambiguous">7.a</l><l xml:id="m-b9380ab4-24e4-4a2b-b220-6f3903f961c4" facs="#m-e684b964-816a-44f6-8cd6-c329dfaadf9d" label="lyrics-like">X-órtum est"</l><l xml:id="m-ca2e79f8-8329-4ba6-87e3-1db94f3ce59b" facs="#m-fcc522e4-4f4a-41a3-b087-8f06d673d7db" label="lyrics-like">dé-dit timéntibus se. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-8ad8c8d4-d878-4808-88c2-e0d7f1127326" facs="#m-3cec8b74-8451-414b-9d6a-adbda260a6ef" label="ambiguous">*</l><l xml:id="m-94576ede-7396-4773-9628-6f58030957a5" facs="#m-7fe26d57-7b21-4766-ab7a-874a8eeb393e" label="lyrics-like">in ténebris lúmen réctis; mi séri-cors et mi-se-rá-tor Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-a0ba84be-e999-497a-9431-eef7d56d1049" facs="#m-dfc2dbe3-b8ed-44c5-9d7c-723f22b909bf" label="ambiguous">4. Ant.6"*–1=</l><l xml:id="m-9d32caed-357c-4e13-96e5-4554893028c3" facs="#m-3e1770a1-de32-4759-bb8a-7decf9b113b8" label="ambiguous">8. e</l><l xml:id="m-2ed78d8f-ba67-4b2d-af26-23f073a35442" facs="#m-397e8323-160f-4b14-b31d-c3ddee8f9efc" label="lyrics-like">Uid retríbu-am" Dómino</l><l xml:id="m-88ec0557-98aa-4db0-94d0-a94beaf529d7" facs="#m-0b241661-aabc-4d13-b249-8ab1dd3855f7" label="ambiguous">minus. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-72061c02-64ae-4ea9-9544-55af722a1f32" facs="#m-6e8e4d14-72b9-4d37-8fc1-5707aa7fa0e9" label="lyrics-like">pro ómni-bus quae retríbu-it mí-hi?</l><l xml:id="m-3d4b56ed-ae2f-45c7-8226-cfee4807838e